# Multi-Tenant Branch Isolation, Security & Sub-500ms Performance Optimization Plan

This document details an exhaustive in-depth audit of the Restaurant Management System for **Route Security Protection**, **Multi-Tenant Branch Isolation**, and **Sub-500ms Latency Optimization** under a production capacity of **50+ Restaurants, 5,000+ Orders/Day, and 300+ Concurrent Drivers**.

---

## Executive Summary & Performance SLA Assessment

| Metric / Requirement | Target SLA | Current Audit Finding | Status / Action |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **API Response Time** | **< 500ms** (Target: < 100ms) | Uncompressed payloads, heavy aggregations, per-request DB connect | ⚠️ **Needs Compression + Caching + Startup Connection** |
| **Route Protection** | **100% Protected** (Super Admin / Branch JWT) | `orders`, `employees`, `expenses`, `delivery` routes lack auth middleware | 🚨 **CRITICAL SECURITY RISK: Unprotected endpoints** |
| **Multi-Tenant Security** | **100% Branch Isolated** | Unscoped fallback logic, un-indexed customer queries, global unique driverId | ⚠️ **Requires Strict Branch Scoping & Indexing** |
| **Peak Throughput** | **5,000+ Orders/Day** (~500/hr peak) | Full `Order.countDocuments()` on every order creation + `maxPoolSize: 10` | ⚠️ **DB Pool Exhaustion & Order Creation Spikes** |

