## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Route Protection Middleware Enforcement**:
> Several core backend routes (`/api/orders/*`, `/api/employees/*`, `/api/expenses/*`, `/api/delivery/*`, `/api/promos/*`) currently lack JWT authentication middleware. We recommend applying `protectBranch` to POS operational routes and `protectSuperAdmin` to administrative routes to prevent unauthorized access.

> [!WARNING]
> **Sub-500ms Optimization Package**:
> To guarantee sub-500ms API response times across 50+ stores:
> 1. Add Express `compression` middleware (reduces JSON payload size by up to 80%).
> 2. Initialize MongoDB connection pool once on server startup with `maxPoolSize: 50`.
> 3. Implement in-memory TTL caching for heavy menu feeds (`/api/menu/pos-feed`).
> 4. Remove `Order.countDocuments()` from order creation, replacing it with atomic `OrderCounter` increments.

